ry.md \\u00a74): direct bonds at         `payoutPerNET = backingPerToken \\u00d7 (1 \\u2212 INVERSE_SPREAD_BPS)`.         Seller-initiated and fully permissionless \\u2014 no trigger, no keeper:         hitting the bid is only rational when market trades below         backing \\u00d7 (1 \\u2212 spread), so it functions as the standing floor bid.         All NET received is burned; every fill is strictly accretive.         Capacity: INVERSE_EPOCH_CAP_BPS of liquid (non-Morpho) reserves         per epoch, fresh each epoch, no rollover. The TWAP oracle is used         as a fail-closed liveness gate (mechanism \\u00a72): out-of-band oracle         \\u2192 no settlement. Backing itself is k-based (2\\u00b7\\u221a(x\\u00b7y)), so the         settlement inputs are not spot-manipulable.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/InverseBond.sol\":\"InverseBond\"},\"evmVersion\":\"osaka\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":800},\"remappings\":[\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/Constants.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xda65d528b433b08b03599f230167688c7bcea61fb918b724ee230c8a71f5abc8\",\"license\":\"AGPL-3.0-only\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://510d9958afdd32b5c946c7ac24977412f5820ceea71f118cc475e426a3d893f5\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmQpsHGeJwsVArqQPxXHf2TzAaoyM1LjautRAPpXupjWDG\"]},\"src/InverseBond.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x39e42e8846149f1e3628932fb81577992eac3cec8b9a95b42b56e545110bbcac\",\"license\":\"AGPL-3.0-only\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://d3447baa515fb84df15cb5753b28a5f4def48f4c3a0eade78fcf8d4912758869\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmUxKLEMVTiy8G92TkW1Y3Py97AWTPN99W3RZdmt7iiBLp\"]},\"src/interfaces/IGenesisBond.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x8112f51e9ca6b8d7363b06a7f21b2c71d9e235fb2d0abc1db770fcc7bdc9a752\",\"license\":\"AGPL-3.0-only\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://a6b2f1977be131bb276da257d86717accf0e33fc0a6434485182cb21f6f79cf2\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmT1LbxosnbqiPk2iPEo66NZ5nQPZBNDhhVyhv22qysnSx\"]},\"src/interfaces/IInverseBond.